Well, apparently you had died previously.

In my experience, one of the things that is most difficult about
Nethack is paying attention. It seems that you had died and did not
notice. Maybe as part of a big fight with lots of messages that get
skipped over without really reading. (The other difficult part is
playing cautiously enough - to retreat when it is called for.)

If you are looking for game play advice, I would say deal with these
dangerous, or at least awkward, monsters with a ranged attack, rather
than letting them turn you to stone or peel enchantments off your main
weapon. Use spells, wands, daggers, even rocks in a pinch (especially
while standing on Elebereth to keep them from attacking you).

Oh, to address the subject line: I'm afraid it would be YASD. You knew
you were being stoned, you apparently had a spare amulet of life
saving, it should have been on. (And actually, where was your lizard
corpse? One bite of that stops the stoning. The first lizard I kill I
carry for the rest of the game just to make sure this YASD does not
happen.)

